# Rendered avatar clips — regenerable from narration/ via `yarn narration:build`,
# and far too large to version. manifest.json is kept: it records the cue times
# and doubles as the build cache, so tracking it means a rebuild only re-renders
# the slides whose prose actually changed.
public/narration/*.mp4
public/narration/*.mp3
public/narration/avatar-still.jpg
